
Contents of "cnet:mail/outbound/"

    - This directory is where CNet stores all outgoing message packets and
NetMail items. JamScan looks in this directory for packets to crunch even
further.

    - You should also create a "Packets/" directory INSIDE this directory
for use by JamScan. Don't store anything of your OWN in here, as Jam-Mail
deletes the contents of this subdirectory after completing it's work.

